isaster team for ${d} damage.`);
    flash(`${s.enemy.emoji} <b>CONSEQUENCES</b><br>${d} party damage`);
    if(s.hp<=0){lose();return;}
    s.playerEnergy=Math.min(s.maxEnergy,s.playerEnergy+2);
    s.nomiEnergy=Math.min(s.maxEnergy,s.nomiEnergy+2);
    s.playerHand=drawHand(playerDeck,s.playerExhausted);
    s.nomiHand=drawHand(nomiDeck,s.nomiExhausted);
    s.turn='player';
    s.busy=false;
    log(`🔄 <b>NEW ROUND.</b> ${escapeHTML(s.playerName)} goes first. Both hands refreshed. +2 energy each (max ${s.maxEnergy}).`);
    render();
  },900);
}

function showDefeatedTransition(enemy,isFinal,onContinue){
  const overlay=document.createElement('div');
  overlay.className='talkFlash defeatedFlash';
  const label=document.createElement('div');
  label.className='talkName';
  label.textContent=isFinal?'FINAL BAD DECISION SURVIVED':'ENEMY DEFEATED';
  const body=document.createElement('div');
  body.className='talkText defeatedText';
  body.innerHTML=`${enemy.emoji} <b>${escapeHTML(enemy.name)}</b><br><span>${isFinal?'Against all available evidence, you won.':'It has been removed from the problem ecosystem.'}</span>`;
  const sub=document.createElement('div');
  sub.className='talkMeta';
  sub.textContent=isFinal?'This outcome will be difficult to explain to insurance.':'Take your victory lap. The next catastrophe can wait.';
  const actions=document.createElement('div');
  actions.className='talkActions';
  const next=document.createElement('button');
  next.textContent=isFinal?'CLAIM DUBIOUS VICTORY':'NEXT BAD DECISION';
  next.onclick=()=>{overlay.remove(); onContinue();};
  actions.appendChild(next);
  overlay.append(label,body,sub,actions);
  document.body.appendChild(overlay);
}

function finishEnemyDefeat(){
  if(s.battleResolved)return true;
  s.battleResolved=true;
  s.wins++;
  const defeated={...s.enemy};
  const finisher=s.lastResolvedAction?{...s.lastResolvedAction}:null;
  s.pendingEncounterUpdate={enemy:defeated,finisher};
  log(`💀 <b>${escapeHTML(defeated.name)} has been defeated by teamwork of questionable legality.</b>`);
  render();
  const isFinal=s.wins>=5;
  showDefeatedTransition(defeated,isFinal,()=>{
    if(isFinal){
      queueContinuityUpdate(s.pendingEncounterUpdate,null,true);
      s.pendingEncounterUpdate=null;
      win();
      return;
    }
    s.enemyIndex++;
    s.hp=Math.min(s.maxHp,s.hp+6);
    nextEnemy();
  });
  return true;
}

function checkBattleEnd(){
  if(s.hp<=0){lose();return true;}
  if(s.enemy.hp<=0)return finishEnemyDefeat();
  return false;
}

function win(){
  $('playerHand').innerHTML='';
  $('nomiHand').innerHTML='';
  $('turnBanner').innerHTML='🏆 <b>CO-OP DISASTER COMPLETE.</b>';
  $('enemy').innerHTML=`<div class='enemyTitle'>🏆 RUN COMPLETE</div>`;
  log(`<b>${escapeHTML(s.playerName)} and ${escapeHTML(s.nomiName)} survived five catastrophes.</b> Friendship has been legally classified as a weapon.`);
}

function lose(){
  $('playerHand').innerHTML='';
  $('nomiHand').innerHTML='';
  $('turnBanner').innerHTML='💀 <b>BAD DECISION ACHIEVED.</b>';
  $('enemy').innerHTML=`<div class='enemyTitle'>💀 PARTY WIPED</div>`;
  log(`<b>${escapeHTML(s.playerName)} and ${escapeHTML(s.nomiName)} have been defeated.</b> The goat's lawyers have named both of you.`);
}

$('scenarioPrev').onclick=()=>changeScenario(-1);
$('scenarioNext').onclick=()=>changeScenario(1);
$('connectNomi').onclick=connectNomi;
$('providerSelect').onchange=updateProviderUI;
$('mockMode').onclick=useMockMode;
$('start').onclick=start;
$('newRun').onclick=()=>location.reload();

let rememberedProvider='nomi';
try{rememberedProvider=sessionStorage.getItem('badDecisionsProvider')||'nomi';}catch(_e){}
$('providerSelect').value=rememberedProvider;
updateProviderUI();

if(rememberedProvider==='kindroid'){
  let rememberedKey='',rememberedId='',rememberedName='';
  try{
    rememberedKey=sessionStorage.getItem('badDecisionsKindroidKey')||'';
    rememberedId=sessionStorage.getItem('badDecisionsKindroidId')||'';
    rememberedName=sessionStorage.getItem('badDecisionsKindroidName')||'';
  }catch(_e){}
  if(rememberedKey)$('apiKey').value=rememberedKey;
  if(rememberedId)$('kindroidId').value=rememberedId;
  if(rememberedName)$('kindroidName').value=rememberedName;
  if(rememberedKey||rememberedId||rememberedName){
    setApiStatus('Kindroid details restored for this app session. Click CONNECT KINDROID to validate and arm them.');
  }
}else{
  let remembered='';
  try{remembered=sessionStorage.getItem('badDecisionsNomiKey')||'';}catch(_e){}
  if(remembered){
    $('apiKey').value=remembered;
    setApiStatus('Nomi API key restored for this app session. Click CONNECT NOMI to load your Nomis.');
  }
}

renderScenarioPicker();
